{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"4902300400010","name":"透","text":"え……\r\nこれ……え？","trans":"诶……\n这……诶？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-4","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ははっ、なんだこれってなるよな\r\n一応、バクダンおにぎりってやつなんだけど","trans":"哈哈，会忍不住想啥玩意儿吧\n算是，那个叫炸弹饭团的东西啦","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902300400020","name":"透","text":"あー……\r\nえ、手作り？","trans":"啊——……\n诶，手工做的？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-6","name":"プロデューサー","text":"まあ、具を入れて丸く握っただけだけどな","trans":"嘛，就是塞了馅捏成圆的而已","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-7","name":"プロデューサー","text":"さすがに俺をあげることはできないからさ\r\n俺が作った大きなもの、ってことで","trans":"总不能把我送出去嘛\n就当是我做的大东西，这个意思","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902300400030","name":"透","text":"おー\r\nナイス","trans":"哦——\n不错","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902300400040","name":"透","text":"────じゃあ、実食","trans":"────那，开吃","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902300400060","name":"透","text":"……おー\r\n美味しい","trans":"……哦——\n好吃","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-18","name":"プロデューサー","text":"おっ、本当か！？","trans":"哦，真的吗！？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902300400070","name":"透","text":"うん","trans":"嗯","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902300400080","name":"透","text":"てか、めっちゃ具……","trans":"话说，超多料……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-22","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ははっ、めっちゃグーか","trans":"哈哈，是超赞吗","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902300400090","name":"透","text":"ふふっ\r\nじゃなくて","trans":"呵呵\n不是啦","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902300400100","name":"透","text":"いくらとか、鮭とか\r\nそっちの具","trans":"鱼籽啦，鲑鱼啦\n是那种料","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-27","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ああ……！\r\n『めっちゃ具が入ってる』ってことか！","trans":"啊啊……！\n是“塞了超多料”的意思啊！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-28","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ははっ\r\nごめんな、勘違いして","trans":"哈哈\n抱歉啊，搞错了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902300400110","name":"透","text":"ううん\r\n違わないかも","trans":"没有啦\n说不定也没错","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902300400120","name":"透","text":"めっちゃグー\r\nこのバクダン","trans":"超赞\n这个炸弹饭团","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902300400130","name":"透","text":"────ありがと、作ってくれて","trans":"────谢啦，帮我做这个","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}